<BaseLayout title="UXO symbol guidelines | UXO.INFO" description="Guidelines for the UXO.INFO awareness symbol.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">The UXO.INFO symbol</p><h1>A symbol made to travel.</h1><p class="lead">We hope this mark becomes recognizable over time as a visual tool for UXO education and awareness across languages and borders.</p><img class="symbol-showcase" src="/images/uxo-symbol-mywa-works.jpg" alt="UXO.INFO awareness symbol: an information mark and stylised explosion within a triangular hazard sign" width="1536" height="1536" /></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><h2>Use is encouraged. Ownership is not transferred.</h2></div><div class="copy"><p>UXO.INFO owns this mark. Legitimate educational, awareness, research, and public-interest use is encouraged. Attribution to UXO.INFO is preferred whenever practical.</p><p>Original artwork by <a href="https://vgen.co/mywaworks" rel="noopener noreferrer">MYWA WORKS</a>.</p><p>The mark may be reproduced in presentations, publications, signage, informational materials, and responsible online communication that supports its purpose.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--quiet"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Please do not</p><h2>Protect the meaning of the mark.</h2></div><ol class="numbered"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Claim authorship or ownership</h3><p>Do not represent the symbol as your work or property.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Register it as your own mark</h3><p>Do not register this symbol, or a confusingly similar version, as your trademark or other proprietary mark.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Imply endorsement or affiliation</h3><p>Do not suggest that UXO.INFO endorses, sponsors, or is affiliated with you without permission.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><h3>Sell or license it as your IP</h3><p>Do not sell, license, or otherwise offer the symbol as your own intellectual property.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="section section--deep"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">A living public symbol</p><h2>Use it responsibly.</h2></div><div class="copy"><p>This is human-readable guidance, not a substitute for formal legal terms. For a use not clearly covered here, or for partnerships and high-visibility applications, please <a href="/contact">contact UXO.INFO</a>.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
